n_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"地理志，河陽縣屬河內郡。","note_content_jianti_auto":"地理志，河阳县属河内郡。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"93e09dec-db0e-11ef-8ae7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"93e09dd5-db0e-11ef-bee1-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"hù","source_anchor_text":"大將軍朱祜等十一將","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":36,"text":"祜","tongjian_id":"cc987789-cb25-5a72-8f07-eca44e8e70c4"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"93e09dd5-db0e-11ef-bee1-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"wěi","source_anchor_text":"將軍圍朱鮪於洛陽八","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":44,"text":"鮪","tongjian_id":"97b6b840-13c8-5a6a-ac35-3d18f9e3c924"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"懷","place_name_jianti_auto":"怀","resolved_place_entity_id":889,"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"93e09df0-db0e-11ef-925b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、两汉 三国（卷二）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"是时，赤眉已入长安，更始败没。邓禹畏赤眉之强，引军北至栒...","context_before":"...邓禹亦略定河东，自汾阴渡河而西[汾阴，见今山西河津县]。","source_end_index":806,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"f908cd4d-ba0f-5d87-a39e-ef88b491dfe1","source_start_index":787,"source_text":"吴汉等诸将共围洛阳，洛阳下，遂定都焉。"}],"path":"历代州域形势纪要/二、两汉 三国（卷二）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"]。","context_before":"...五社津，又名五度津。更始将朱鲔守洛阳，遣兵度巩河，攻温。","source_end_index":90,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"6ee16bf7-a9fd-5c64-8f77-a0f61087cafa","source_start_index":57,"source_text":"又建武初，遣将军耿弇等军五社津，备荥阳以东，而使吴汉等围洛阳，是也"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、河南府（卷四十八）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"]。","context_before":"...五社津，又名五度津。更始将朱鲔守洛阳，遣兵度巩河，攻温。","source_end_index":90,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a44ca52c-bb6c-5e6c-9b84-78265a179660","source_start_index":57,"source_text":"又建武初，遣将军耿弇等军五社津，备荥阳以东，而使吴汉等围洛阳，是也"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/二、河南府（卷四十八）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/三、怀庆府（卷四十九）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"元和三年，北巡，耕于怀。晋初仍为河内郡治。永嘉四年，刘渊...","context_before":"...。《竹书纪年》：秦师伐郑，次于怀。汉置怀县，为河内郡治。","source_end_index":105,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"658af013-7c42-5238-8f56-70879a6d9617","source_start_index":96,"source_text":"后汉建武初，幸怀。"},{"context_after":"晋仍为河阳县。后魏因之。太和中，筑河阳城。北齐置河阳关。...","context_before":"...》：赵惠文王十一年，董叔与魏氏伐宋，得河阳于魏。汉置县。","source_end_index":85,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"6ca98525-bbc9-5c3f-8ed2-e6c386eb0743","source_start_index":76,"source_text":"建武初，帝幸河阳。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/三、怀庆府（卷四十九）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"11己亥，帝幸懷，遣耿弇、陳俊軍五社津，備滎陽以東；使吳漢率建議大將軍朱祜等十一將軍圍朱鮪於洛陽。八月，進幸河陽。","content_fanyi":"七月己亥日，光武帝巡幸怀县，派耿弇、陈俊驻军五社津，防备荥阳以东的敌情；同时命吴汉率领建议大将军朱祜等十一位将军，将朱鲔围困在洛阳。八月，光武帝继续南行，驾临河阳。","content_jianti_auto":"11己亥，帝幸怀，遣耿弇、陈俊军五社津，备荥阳以东；使吴汉率建议大将军朱祜等十一将军围朱鲔于洛阳。八月，进幸河阳。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3045,"number":11,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第四十 (漢紀三十二) / 世祖光武皇帝上之上 / 建武元年 / 第 20 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"93e09dd5-db0e-11ef-bee1-a0d3651f611f","year_int":25},"tongjian_id":"93e09dd5-db0e-11ef-bee1-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"懷","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"懷","place_name_jianti_auto":"怀","place_note":"河南武陟","resolved_place_entity_id":889,"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"93e78413-db0e-11ef-9bae-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"19十一月，甲午，上幸懷。","content_fanyi":"十一月甲午日，即三十日，光武帝巡幸怀县。","content_jianti_auto":"19十一月，甲午，上幸怀。",